        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yocia okwero nino madit me Kato (Paska) pa Rwot i Jerucalem. Ci guneko litino romi me Kato (Paska) i nino dwe apar wiye aŋwen me dwe mukwoŋo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "En oyero ajwagi ci oketogi i dog ticgi, dok ocuko cwinygi i kom tic ma i ot pa Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok owaco bot Lulevi ma gin aye gupwonyo jo Icrael ducu-ni, ma gin jo maleŋ i nyim Rwot, ni, “Wuket canduk maleŋ i ot ma Solomon wod pa Daudi, kabaka me Icrael, yam ogero; pe myero dok wubed ka tinone i wi gwokwu. Wun doŋ wuti bot Rwot Lubaŋawu ki lwakke jo Icrael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.8.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tek 8.14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuyubbe kun wulubo dog odi pa kwariwu ki dulwu, kun wulubo bene gin ma yam Daudi kabaka me ‘Icrael ociko ki gin ma wode Solomon ociko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok wucuŋ i kabedo maleŋ, wucuŋ kun wulubo dog odi pa kwari utmegiwu ma gin jo me lobo-ni, kun dul acel acel pa Lulevi ocuŋ pi dog ot acel acel pa lwak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kit meno doŋ wunek litino romi me Kato (Paska), wulonnye kenwu, wuyub gin ma mitte pi utmegiwu, wek gulub lok pa Rwot ma Moses ociko.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yocia omiyo litino romi ki litino dyegi alip pyeradek, ki twoni alip adek, bot lwak pi gityer me Kato (Paska) pi lwak jo ducu ma onoŋo gitye kenyo. Jami magi ducu jami ma oa i kom jami pa kabaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ki rwodi bene gumiyo gin ma cwinygi opwoyo bot lwak, bot ajwagi ki bot Lulevi. Ilkia, Jekaria ki Jekiel, ma gin ludito ma giloyo tic ma i ot pa Lubaŋa, gumiyo bot ajwagi litino romi ki dyegi alip aryo ki miya abicel ki twoni miya adek me gityer me Kato (Paska). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Konania ki omegine, ki Cemaya ki Netanel, ki Kacabia, Jeyel ki. Jojabad, ma gin ludito pa Lulevi, gumiyo litino romi ki dyegi alip abic, ki twoni miya abic, bot Lulevi me gityer me Kato (Paska).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare ma doŋ giyubo jami ducu kakare, ajwagi gucako cuŋ i kabedogi, ki Lulevi bene gucuŋ i dul ki dul i dog ticgi kun gin ducu gilubo gin ma kabaka ociko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Guneko litino romi me Kato (Paska), ci ajwagi ticgi obedo me coro remo ma gigamo ki bot Lulevi ina gitye ka yaŋo riŋo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare ma gitimo man giketo dul mukene me gitum awaŋa cen, ma gibipoko i kin lwak kun gilubo dog odi pa kwarigi, wek gutyer bot Rwot, macalo gicoyo i buk pa Moses. Ci gutiyo ki twoni bene kit meno. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.8+EXO.12.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nia 12.8-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gubulo litino romi me Kato (Paska) ki mac kun gilubo cik ma yam giciko; ento jami me gityer maleŋ gutedo ateda ki otako ki agulu, ki cupuriya, ka gucako tinone gutyero bot lwak oyotoyot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ne meno gubedo ka yubo jami pigi kengi ki pi ajwagi, pien ajwagi ma gin likwayo pa Aron onoŋo gitye ki tic madwoŋ twatwal me waŋo gitum awaŋa-gu ki moo dwolo-gu nio wa i wor, Kit meno Lulevi guyubo jami pigi kengi ki pi ajwagi bene ma gin likwayo pa Aron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.25.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Tek 25.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Likwayo pa Acap ma gin luwer, gubedo i kabedogi macalo Daudi, Acap, Keman, ki Jedutun ma lanen pa kabaka onoŋo guciko; ki lugwok doggola ot pa Rwot ducu gubedo i doggola acel acel. Pe gumito weko ticgi pien guniaŋ ni utmegigi ma Lulevi gubedo ka yubbe pigi bene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meno aye kit ma giyubo ki tic pa Rwot i nino-nu, pi kwero nino madit me Kato (Paska) ki pi tyero gitum awaŋa i kom keno tyer pa Rwot, kun gilubo lok ma kabaka Yocia ociko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.12.1+EXO.12.2+EXO.12.3+EXO.12.4+EXO.12.5+EXO.12.6+EXO.12.7+EXO.12.8+EXO.12.9+EXO.12.10+EXO.12.11+EXO.12.12+EXO.12.13+EXO.12.14+EXO.12.15+EXO.12.16+EXO.12.17+EXO.12.18+EXO.12.19+EXO.12.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Nia 12.1-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo Icrael ducu ma onoŋo gitye kunnu gukwero nino madit me Kato (Paska) i kare meno, ki dok gukwero bene nino madito me Mugati ma Tobi Pe Iye pi nino abiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pe tye nino mo madit me Kato (Paska) ma gikwero kit man i Icrael nia i kare pa lanebi Camuel. Dok pe tye laker mo i kin luker me Icrael ma yam okwero nino me Kato (Paska) macalo Yocia okwero, kacel ki ajwagi ki Lulevi, jo Juda ki jo Jerucalem ducu ma onoŋo gubedo tye, ki jo ducu ma gibedo i Jerucalem, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I mwaka me apar wiye aboro me loc pa Yocia en aye gikwero iye nino man madit me Kato (Paska).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ŋe man ducu, ma doŋ Yocia otyeko yubo ot pa Lubaŋa, Neko kabaka me Ejipt ocito ka lweny i Karkemic ma cok ki kulu Euprate, ki Yociaa bene ocrto ka lweny i kome cut. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Neko ocwalo kwena bot Yocia ma guwacci, “Imito, watimme niŋniŋ: kaba ka me Juda? Tin an pe abino ka lweny i komi, ento abino ka lwenyo i kom jo ma atye ka lweny i komgi; dok Lubaŋa ociko me tiyo man oyotoyot. Wek pyem ki Lubaŋa ma tye kweda-ni miyo neki woko,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Yocia pe oloko ŋeye ki kabaka Neko, ci orukke macalo dano mo ata wek elweny kwede. Yocia pe owinyo lok pa Neko ma oa ki i dog Lubaŋa kadi ki acel ento ocerre ocito ka lweny kwede iba; Megido, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cutcut gutugi celo kabaka Yocia woko; ci kabaka owaco bot luticce ni, “Wukwanya woko ki i wan lweny, pien doŋ gutyeko keto ret marac twatwal, i, koma,” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 35:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci luticce gukwanye woko ki I gadigadine gukete i gadigadine me aryone ka gutere i Jerucalem. Yocia oto, ci giyike i lyel pa kwarine. Jo Juda ki jo Jerucalem ducu gukumo matek pi Yocia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.35.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.35.24"
            ]
